{"t":"Hagor","s":"hagor-6f05f","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_10_e4e084.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hagor</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJakundaf Desert\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subarea\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Subarea</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Jakundaf%20Desert\">Jakundaf Desert</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Map</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"posx\"><center><div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713150014&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_10_e4e084.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32654,32151,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32654, 32151, 10)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Adventurer</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 2000<br/>Christmas Update 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221214140159&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hagor_06cb3b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Hagor.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Jakundaf%20Desert\">Jakundaf Desert</a> dungeon, 3 levels down.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Hagor is an explorer and traveler. He wants to explore all of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a> and discover its secrets. He calls himself \"old hunter\".\nHagor knows much about the desert, and he mentions its name - the <a href=\"#/wiki/Jakundaf%20Desert\">Jakundaf Desert</a>.<br/>\nTo get to Hagor, go west from the <a href=\"#/quest/panpipe-quest\">Panpipe Quest</a> and then south to a large room with 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>. Then go down the hole to the east of the room and down another level. Here you'll find Hagor.<br/>Hagor will give you <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204022\">Key 4022</a> if you give him a <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nHagor: Greetings, adventurer Player. What leads you to me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Morrin</b><br/>\nHagor: Ah, I remember that man. We made a deal, guess about what.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>key</b><br/>\nHagor: Right! We can make the same deal if you give a fresh delicious roll. Do you have any?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nHagor: Oh, fine! Here you are.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hagor</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204022\"><img alt=\"Silver Key\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Key_57723b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204022\">Key 4022</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Hagor.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nHagor: Greetings, adventurer <i>Player</i>. What <b>leads</b> you to me?<br/>\nPlayer: leads / job<br/>\nHagor: I am a traveller. I have been travelling through the lands of Tibia for many years. Recently I have been spending my time exploring the Jakundaf <b>Desert</b>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>door</b><br/>\nHagor: Which door are you talking about? If it is locked, maybe you should try to find a key for it!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>book</b><br/>\nHagor: Yes, I really can recommend reading books. It might help you find what you are looking for!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nHagor: Tibianus is our king. To be honest, I didn't hear much of him till now.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>library</b><br/>\nHagor: There is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Desert%20Dungeon%20Library\">library</a> in here, right. I assume you are talking about this library. It's locked, as far as I know. But somewhere there has to be a key... maybe the librarian knows more?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nHagor: My name is Hagor, the old hunter.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>offer</b><br/>\nHagor: Go ahead. I don't sell or buy anything!<br/>\nPlayer: roll<br/>\nHagor: Oh, yes, I love them!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>secret</b><br/>\nHagor: There are many secrets. But I fear, I can't tell you much about them. They are also secret to me...<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Tibia</b><br/>\nHagor: The gods made this world full of fascinating secrets and I will search them till my end.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>treasure</b><br/>\nHagor: Someone told me - I can't remember who it was - that there was a treasure hidden nearby.<br/>\nPlayer: god<br/>\nHagor: There are a lot of gods we believe in. Maybe you should check out different books to find out something about them.<br/>\nPlayer: gharonk<br/>\nHagor: Gharonk is a very old language, only spoken by a few people. It's not a very complex language, but that does not mean that it is easy to understand!<br/>\nPlayer: time<br/>\nHagor: Time has no meaning to me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>weapon</b><br/>\nHagor: Weapons? Do you have some? You better know how to use them!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>sword</b><br/>\nHagor: Do you mean any sword in particular? Or just any sword?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Excalibug</b><br/>\nHagor: I heared rumours that there is a sword called so. I don't know if it exists.<br/>\nPlayer: fight<br/>\nHagor: Fighting is an art. Know it and you will be strong, ignore it and you will die soon!<br/>\nPlayer: guild<br/>\nHagor: There are many different guilds in Tibia. They come and go, come and go...<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></b><br/>\nHagor: Is this the city to the north? I heard rumours about it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Jakundaf%20Desert\">Desert</a></b><br/>\nHagor: Yes, it's big, isn't it?<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nHagor: Thais... It's a big city in Middle-Tibia. Lots of people live there.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Morrin</b><br/>\nHagor: Ah, I remember that man. We made a deal, guess about what.<br/>\nPlayer: help<br/>\nHagor: I'd really like to help you. Could you specify your request?<br/>\nPlayer: exit<br/>\nHagor: Yes, there is an exit for these dungeons. Just find the teleporter.<br/>\nPlayer: way<br/>\nHagor: Which way are you looking for in particular?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nHagor: Good bye.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hagor</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-desert-dungeon-quest"],"pos":{"x":32654,"y":32151,"z":10}}